\title{The First Time:\\ A Philosophical Treatise on Humanity's Unprecedented Opportunity\\
to Choose Correctly Before the Catastrophe}

\author{
  Rickey Jay Bennett II\\
  Independent Researcher\\
  \texttt{independant\_researcher@rickeyjaybennettii.org}
